[node name="EntranceRoom" type="Node3D"]
editor_description = "The lobby, just inside the front doors (the exterior's doorway is at x = 0). Kept short (6 m) because the rooms have 60 m of depth in all; see MuseumLayout.DEPTH. Dressed by asset item P3.5: the ticket desk (west) and coat check (east) face the 3 m path down the middle, which stays clear from door to door; the map greets you at the door and the banners face you on the far wall."
